*.tgz
lerna-debug.log
images/
src/generated/*
# EXCEPT the animation atlas metadata: pure JSON meta (no pixels) that the RenderableUnit
# animation tests assert against. Committing it lets CI run those tests for real instead of
# silently skipping them; regenerate with `bun run generate:animations` when art changes.
!src/generated/animation_atlases.ts
# EXCEPT the image key catalog: the exact key universe emitted by generate_image_imports.js from
# the private art Drive. Committing it lets CI's generate_ci_stubs.js rebuild a manifest whose
# enumerable key set (and therefore every bundle-split bucket size) matches local runs exactly,
# instead of approximating it from source scans. Regenerate with `bun run generate:images`.
!src/generated/image_keys.json

# env / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Tracked on purpose: no secrets beyond the public Google client id — these ARE the
# builds' baked API origins (.env.production already tracked via a historic force-add).
!.env.production
!.env.test
